<!doctype html><html lang="fr"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>OMNIX — Programme</title><style>body{margin:0;background:#080811;color:#fff;font-family:Inter,system-ui,sans-serif}.wrap{max-width:900px;margin:auto;padding:55px 22px}.hero{padding:30px;border:1px solid rgba(139,92,246,.2);border-radius:24px;background:linear-gradient(145deg,rgba(124,92,255,.12),rgba(15,23,42,.7))}.eyebrow{color:#a78bfa;font-size:11px;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:1.5px}.hero h1{font-size:38px;margin:12px 0}.muted{color:#9aa3b8;line-height:1.7}.linkbox{margin-top:25px;display:flex;gap:10px}.linkbox input{flex:1;padding:14px;border-radius:12px;border:1px solid #2a2a3d;background:#0f1020;color:#fff}.btn{border:0;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;background:#7c5cff;color:#fff;font-weight:800;cursor:pointer}.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:12px;margin-top:16px}.card{padding:18px;border:1px solid #232338;border-radius:16px;background:#0e0f1b}.num{font-size:25px;font-weight:900}.label{font-size:10px;color:#737b91;margin-top:4px}@media(max-width:700px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.linkbox{flex-direction:column}}</style>  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/omnix-web.css">
</head><body class="omnix-public"><main class="wrap"><section class="hero"><span class="eyebrow">🚀 PROGRAMME OMNIX</span><h1>Fais connaître OMNIX. Gagne du Premium.</h1><p class="muted">Ton lien personnel redirige vers le serveur officiel. Lorsqu’un nouveau membre est authentifié et que sa présence sur le serveur peut être vérifiée, le parrainage est validé et 7 jours de Premium sont ajoutés au parrain.</p><div class="linkbox"><input id="link" readonly><button class="btn" onclick="copyLink()">Copier</button></div><div class="grid"><div class="card"><div class="num" id="total">—</div><div class="label">Parrainages</div></div><div class="card"><div class="num" id="valid">—</div><div class="label">Validés</div></div><div class="card"><div class="num" id="days">—</div><div class="label">Jours Premium gagnés</div></div></div><p id="status" class="muted" style="margin-top:20px"></p></section></main><%- include('partials/sidebar') %><script>async function load(){try{await fetch('/api/referrals/claim',{method:'POST',credentials:'include',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:'{}'}).catch(()=>{});const r=await fetch('/api/referrals/me',{credentials:'include'});const d=await r.json();if(!r.ok)throw new Error(d.error||'Erreur');const x=d.data||{};document.getElementById('link').value=location.origin+'/referral/go/'+x.code;document.getElementById('total').textContent=x.total||0;document.getElementById('valid').textContent=x.validated||0;document.getElementById('days').textContent=x.rewardedDays||0;document.getElementById('status').textContent='Chaque parrainage validé rapporte 7 jours de Premium.'}catch(e){document.getElementById('status').textContent='Impossible de charger ton programme : '+e.message}}function copyLink(){const i=document.getElementById('link');navigator.clipboard?.writeText(i.value);document.getElementById('status').textContent='Lien copié.'}load();</script></body></html>